<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσμύχω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cause to smoulder away, consume slowly,</i> prob. in
				<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.39
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσμύχονται ὀπωπαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.445
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσμύχουσα: ἔνδον
				ἐρεθίζουσα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδιερεθίζουσα, ὑποκαίουσα,
				θλίβουσα, καταπονοῦσα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of fire, <i>smoulder,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				864.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1012.13
			</span></i>; of itching, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Trall.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Febr.</u>
				2
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ νοῦς . .
				ζωπυρε&lt;&gt;͂ται -σμυχόμενος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1656.47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσμύχεταί τι ἀπειλῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					717.51
				</span></i>
			.</div>
